# Project Progress Report

**Project Title:** HosiKe — Hospital Management System
**Date:** March 3, 2026
**Technology Stack:** Django REST Framework (Backend) · React + Vite (Frontend)

---

## 1. Project Overview

HosiKe is a full-stack web-based **Hospital Management System** designed to digitise and streamline hospital workflows. The system supports four distinct user roles — **Admin, Doctor, Nurse, and Patient** — each with a tailored dashboard and dedicated functionality. The application uses JWT-based authentication to enforce role-based access control, ensuring that every user only sees and interacts with the resources relevant to their role.

---

## 2. Project Objectives

| # | Objective | Status |
|---|-----------|--------|
| 1 | Implement secure, role-based authentication | ✅ Complete |
| 2 | Build an Admin panel for hospital oversight | ✅ Complete |
| 3 | Build a Doctor workbench for clinical workflows | ✅ Complete |
| 4 | Build a Nurse dashboard for task & medication management | ✅ Complete |
| 5 | Build a Patient portal for self-service access | ✅ Complete |
| 6 | Implement appointment scheduling & management | ✅ Complete |
| 7 | Implement in-hospital (inpatient) admission workflows | ✅ Complete |
| 8 | Implement clinical messaging between staff | ✅ Complete |
| 9 | Build remote patient monitoring via vitals | ✅ Complete |

---

## 3. Technology Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|-----------|
| **Backend** | Python 3, Django, Django REST Framework |
| **Authentication** | JWT (via `djangorestframework-simplejwt`) |
| **Frontend** | React 18, Vite, Axios |
| **Database** | SQLite (development) |
| **Routing** | React Router v6 |
| **State / Auth** | React Context API |
| **Cross-Origin** | `django-cors-headers` |

