## 8. Conclusion

Significant progress has been made on the HosiKe Hospital Management System. The foundational architecture — a Django REST backend with a React frontend — is solid and scalable. All core modules across all four user roles are implemented and functional. The remaining work is primarily focused on polishing, testing, and documentation ahead of the final submission.
